Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: Yantra
Upstream-Contact: Curtat BV <info@curtat.be>
Source: @SOURCE_URL@
Comment: Machine-readable form of the repository's REUSE.toml, its file
 headers (REUSE 3.3) and THIRD_PARTY.md (installed as
 /usr/share/yantra/THIRD_PARTY.md). The licence texts are in
 /usr/share/doc/yantra/LICENSES/. The radio plugins in
 /usr/lib/yantra/plugins/radios come from yantra-radios with their own
 licence bundle in /usr/share/licenses/yantra-radios (BUNDLE.md: osmo-tetra
 AGPL-3.0-or-later, SoapySDR BSL-1.0, libusb LGPL-2.1-or-later, ...);
 /usr/lib/yantra/libpdfium.so is PDFium (BSD-3-Clause) with the licences of
 its bundled libraries in /usr/share/licenses/pdfium. The complete
 corresponding source is at the Source address above (NFR-01).

